# Orthorhombic polyethylene (PE) fixture, space group Pnam (No. 62, b/c-swapped
# setting of Pnma). a=7.40, b=4.93, c=2.534 A; infinite -(CH2)n- chains along c.
# One carbon asymmetric unit at (0.192, 0.06, 0) expands to 8 C / 4 zigzag chains
# with C-C = 1.53 A. Carbon skeleton only (hydrogens omitted for a minimal test).
data_pe_orthorhombic
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M   'Pnam'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number      62
_cell_length_a                   7.40
_cell_length_b                   4.93
_cell_length_c                   2.534
_cell_angle_alpha                90.0
_cell_angle_beta                 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma                90.0
loop_
_symmetry_equiv_pos_as_xyz
'x, y, z'
'-x+1/2, y+1/2, -z'
'-x, -y+1/2, z+1/2'
'x+1/2, -y, -z+1/2'
'-x, -y, -z'
'x+1/2, -y+1/2, z'
'x, y+1/2, -z+1/2'
'-x+1/2, y, z+1/2'
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
_atom_site_occupancy
_atom_site_disorder_group
C1 C 0.192 0.06 0.0 1.0 0